Description: Avoid assert() with required side effect.
 Make sure the getcontext() call is always made, even if -DNDEBUG is
 used.
Author: Dave Martin
Bug-Ubuntu: https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/wvstreams/+bug/383974
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2024-12-04
Index: wvstreams-salsa/utils/wvtask.cc
===================================================================
